<article class="Page SectionPage">
    


    <div class="Page__wrapper">
        
<div id="2b37b5ee"><ol class="jIjgn7qoTMH3b4e0jW3j" id="breadcrumbs"><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/">Kristiania</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/">For studenter</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/">Utveksling</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/">Internasjonale samarbeidspartnere</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46">Australia</a></li></ol><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['2b37b5ee-json'] = {"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Kristiania","link":"/"},{"name":"For studenter","link":"/for-studenter/"},{"name":"Utveksling","link":"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/"},{"name":"Internasjonale samarbeidspartnere","link":"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/"},{"name":"Australia","link":null}]};</script></div>
        <div class="Page__header">
            <h1 class="Page__title">
Australia
</h1>
                <div class="Page__intro">
<p>Her finner du informasjon om våre samarbeidspartnere i Australia.</p>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Page__body">
        <div class="Richtext Richtext--wide">
            
<div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content"><p>Gå direkte til</p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="#deakin">Deakin University, Melbourne</a></li>
<li><a href="#GU">Griffith University</a></li>
<li><a href="#rmit">Royal Melbourne Institute of Technology, Melbourne</a></li>
<li><a href="#queensland">University of Queensland, Brisbane</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a id="deakin"></a>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="e7b5a14f"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin_university_burwood_campus.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin_university_burwood_campus.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin_university_burwood_campus.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin_university_burwood_campus.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Deakin University, Melbourne</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.deakin.edu.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Deakin University</a>, ligger i Burwood, en trikketur unna Melbourne. Dette er et moderne universitet, med emner relevante for flere studieprogram ved Kristiania. Universitetet har en høy studenttilfredshet, og tar godt imot internasjonale studenter med orienteringsprogrammer, akademisk støtte og sosiale aktiviteter.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/2026-deakin-university-study-abroad-factsheet.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact Sheet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.deakin.edu.au/students/enrolment-fees-and-money/university-handbook" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Se emneoversikt</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.deakin.edu.au/international-students/study-abroad-and-exchange" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Praktisk info om utveksling</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin-university-study-abroad-guide-february-2024.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Study Abroad at Deakin University brosjyre</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.deakin.edu.au/accommodation" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Deakin accommodation</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Det kreves 4 credit points for at det skal tilsvare 30 studiepoeng, det vil normalt bety at du velger 4 ulike emner.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Deakin University er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni (Trimester 2)<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra juni - oktober (Trimester 3)</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['e7b5a14f-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin_university_burwood_campus.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Deakin University, Melbourne","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.deakin.edu.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deakin University</a>, ligger i Burwood, en trikketur unna Melbourne. Dette er et moderne universitet, med emner relevante for flere studieprogram ved Kristiania. Universitetet har en h&oslash;y studenttilfredshet, og tar godt imot internasjonale studenter med orienteringsprogrammer, akademisk st&oslash;tte og sosiale aktiviteter.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/2026-deakin-university-study-abroad-factsheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact Sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deakin.edu.au/students/enrolment-fees-and-money/university-handbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Se emneoversikt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deakin.edu.au/international-students/study-abroad-and-exchange\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Praktisk info om utveksling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/6ff8899e4910420c988bbf77975460b4/deakin-university-study-abroad-guide-february-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Study Abroad at Deakin University brosjyre</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deakin.edu.au/accommodation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deakin accommodation</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Det kreves 4 credit points for at det skal tilsvare 30 studiepoeng, det vil normalt bety at du velger 4 ulike emner.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Deakin University er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni (Trimester 2)<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra juni - oktober (Trimester 3)"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="GU"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="826d9ef1"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/sliit-international-section-transfer-options-griffith-university.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/sliit-international-section-transfer-options-griffith-university.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/sliit-international-section-transfer-options-griffith-university.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/sliit-international-section-transfer-options-griffith-university.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Griffith University</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.griffith.edu.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Griffith University</a> har seks campuser i og rundt Brisbane, Queensland, Australia. For<span> biomedisin: merk at tilbudet tar forbehold om at man til enhver tid finner matchende fagkombinasjoner.</span><p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.griffith.edu.au/study/courses" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Se emneoversikt&nbsp;(generell)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.griffith.edu.au/international/global-mobility/inbound" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Praktisk info om utveksling</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NuPWIH4LE6o" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/study-abroad-2026-guide.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Study abroad guide 2026</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Det kreves 4 emner/courses a 10 credits som tilsvarer 30 studiepoeng, samtidig tilbyr Griffith et valgfritt 5. emne.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Griffith er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni (Trimester 1)<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra oktober - februar<br><br></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['826d9ef1-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/sliit-international-section-transfer-options-griffith-university.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Griffith University","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.griffith.edu.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Griffith University</a> har seks campuser i og rundt Brisbane, Queensland, Australia. For<span> biomedisin: merk at tilbudet tar forbehold om at man til enhver tid finner matchende fagkombinasjoner.</span></p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.griffith.edu.au/study/courses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Se emneoversikt&nbsp;(generell)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.griffith.edu.au/international/global-mobility/inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Praktisk info om utveksling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NuPWIH4LE6o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/2ad9a7e8bcff4c81a8988f873b3dabab/study-abroad-2026-guide.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Study abroad guide 2026</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Det kreves 4 emner/courses a 10 credits som tilsvarer 30 studiepoeng, samtidig tilbyr Griffith et valgfritt 5. emne.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Griffith er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni (Trimester 1)<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - februar<br /><br />"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="rmit"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="dea1c05e"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/9a910b35e37d4f23bfffce4a572c3611/rmit-featured-2.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/9a910b35e37d4f23bfffce4a572c3611/rmit-featured-2.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/9a910b35e37d4f23bfffce4a572c3611/rmit-featured-2.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/9a910b35e37d4f23bfffce4a572c3611/rmit-featured-2.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Royal Melbourne Institute of Technology, Melbourne</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.rmit.edu.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Royal Melbourne Institute of Technology (RMIT)</a>&nbsp;ligger midt i sentrum av Melbourne, omgitt av restauranter, teatre, gallerier og parker. Grunnlagt i 1887, har universitetet en rik historie, og er kjent for sin kompetanse innen teknologi, design og næringsliv.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.rmit.edu.au/study-with-us/international-students/programs-for-international-students/study-abroad-and-exchange/course-selection" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Se emneoversikt</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MpbNQcELVMA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.rmit.edu.au/study-with-us/international-students/programs-for-international-students/study-abroad-and-exchange">Praktisk info om utveksling i RMIT Melbourne</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.rmit.edu.au/students/support-services/international-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.rmit.edu.au/about/our-values" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>
</ul>
<p><span>Det kreves 4 emner/courses a 12 credits som tilsvarer 30 studiepoeng.</span></p>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved RMIT Melbourne er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni (Trimester 1)<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra juli - november (Trimester 2)<br><br></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['dea1c05e-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/9a910b35e37d4f23bfffce4a572c3611/rmit-featured-2.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Royal Melbourne Institute of Technology, Melbourne","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.rmit.edu.au\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Royal Melbourne Institute of Technology (RMIT)</a>&nbsp;ligger midt i sentrum av Melbourne, omgitt av restauranter, teatre, gallerier og parker. Grunnlagt i 1887, har universitetet en rik historie, og er kjent for sin kompetanse innen teknologi, design og n&aelig;ringsliv.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.rmit.edu.au/study-with-us/international-students/programs-for-international-students/study-abroad-and-exchange/course-selection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Se emneoversikt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MpbNQcELVMA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.rmit.edu.au/study-with-us/international-students/programs-for-international-students/study-abroad-and-exchange\">Praktisk info om utveksling i RMIT Melbourne</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.rmit.edu.au/students/support-services/international-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.rmit.edu.au/about/our-values\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>Det kreves 4 emner/courses a 12 credits som tilsvarer 30 studiepoeng.</span></p>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved RMIT Melbourne er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni (Trimester 1)<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra juli - november (Trimester 2)<br /><br />"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="queensland"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="20bbbe3e"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uq.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uq.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uq.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uq.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">University of Queensland, Brisbane</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.uq.edu.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">University of Queensland</a>, er en forskningsintensiv institusjon og rangerer som ett av de 50 beste universitetene i verden. De tilbyr valg og mulighet innen grunn- og doktorgradslæring.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FpWBav4Dbpg">Reklamefilm</a></li>
<li><a href="https://study.uq.edu.au/admissions/study-abroad/choose-your-courses">Se emneoversikt</a>&nbsp;</li>
<li><a href="https://study.uq.edu.au/university-life/living-in-queensland" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Living in Queensland</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.uq.edu.au/studyabroad/">Praktisk info om utveksling til UQ</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uni-queenslnd-study-abroad.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Info fra UQ: Study Abroad and Exchange</a></li>
</ul>
<p><span>Det kreves 4 emner/courses a 2 units som tilsvarer 30 studiepoeng.</span></p>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni (Trimester 1)<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra juli - november</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['20bbbe3e-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uq.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"University of Queensland, Brisbane","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.uq.edu.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">University of Queensland</a>, er en forskningsintensiv institusjon og rangerer som ett av de 50 beste universitetene i verden. De tilbyr valg og mulighet innen grunn- og doktorgradsl&aelig;ring.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FpWBav4Dbpg\">Reklamefilm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://study.uq.edu.au/admissions/study-abroad/choose-your-courses\">Se emneoversikt</a>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://study.uq.edu.au/university-life/living-in-queensland\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Living in Queensland</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uq.edu.au/studyabroad/\">Praktisk info om utveksling til UQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/d5750b30c31d4ac495b8c37f91f13058/uni-queenslnd-study-abroad.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Info fra UQ: Study Abroad and Exchange</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>Det kreves 4 emner/courses a 2 units som tilsvarer 30 studiepoeng.</span></p>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni (Trimester 1)<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra juli - november"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
